WEBVTT

00:06:26.590 --> 00:06:31.554
This project required
thousands of people in multiple countries,

00:06:31.595 --> 00:06:32.847
multiple states,

00:06:32.888 --> 00:06:38.644
to take this vision
and turn it into a concrete thing,

00:06:38.644 --> 00:06:39.937
this telescope.

00:06:39.937 --> 00:06:42.606
And then launch it on a rocket,

00:06:42.606 --> 00:06:46.235
and then have the ability
to use it, to probe

00:06:46.235 --> 00:06:49.864
from right in our local neighborhood

00:06:49.864 --> 00:06:52.241
all the way to the edge
of the known universe

00:06:52.241 --> 00:06:53.784
and everything in between.

00:06:53.826 --> 00:06:56.328
ND: Yeah.
HH: It's amazing to me.

00:06:56.370 --> 00:06:58.122
And everybody had a role to play.

00:06:58.164 --> 00:07:00.374
The beryllium miners